<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Abercrombie &amp; Fitch rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Abercrombie &amp; Fitch rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc analyst Elizabeth Pierce started Abercrombie &amp; Fitch Co with a buy rating on Friday, according to a research report from the firm.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Along with solid fundamentals, we believe the stock is undervalued, as it is trading at 23.5 times and 17.7 times our fiscal 1997 and 1998 EPS of $0.60 and $0.80 respectively,&quot; the report said.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 14.</p>
</text>
